o"><addressbook><name>MITSUI MICHIO</name> <address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NAGAI KIMIYOSHI</name> <address><country>JP</country> </address> </addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>STAUCH GERT</name><address><country>DE</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>WITTMANN JOSEF</name><address><country>DE</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ABB K.K.</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>BOERNER, GUNTER</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MITSUI, MICHIO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NAGAI, KIMIYOSHI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>STAUCH, GERT</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>WITTMANN, JOSEF</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>BOERNER GUNTER</name><address><country>DE</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MITSUI MICHIO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NAGAI KIMIYOSHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>STAUCH GERT</name><address><country>DE</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>WITTMANN JOSEF</name><address><country>DE</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>BOERNER, GUNTER</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MITSUI, MICHIO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NAGAI, KIMIYOSHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>STAUCH, GERT</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>WITTMANN, JOSEF</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A rotary atomizing head type coating device capable of preventing spark discharge from occurring around the rotary atomizing head.  A rotary shaft (9) is made of insulating material and a rotary atomizing head (11) made of insulating resin material is attached to the front end of the rotary shaft (9).  The outer peripheral surface of the rotary atomizing head (11) is formed with an atomizing head semiconductive film (14).  And a first restricting ring (15) installed on a motor body (6) is formed with a first arcuate film (16), while a second restricting ring (17) installed in the rotary atomizing head (11) is formed with a second arcuate film (18).  Further, the outer peripheral surface of the rotary shaft (9) is formed with a current feed semiconductive film (19) positioned between the arcuate films (16, 18).  And a high voltage impressed on an air motor (5) is fed to the paint discharge end edge (12E) of the rotary atomizing head (11) successively through the first arcuate film (16), the current feed semiconductive film (19), the second arcuate film (18), and the atomizing head semiconductive film (14).</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>La présente invention concerne un applicateur de revêtements conçu pour empêcher les décharges d'étincelles autour de la tête d'atomisation rotative. Le dispositif comprend un arbre (9) en matériau isolant et une tête d'atomisation rotative (11) en résine isolante qui est solidaire de l'extrémité avant de l'arbre (9). La surface périphérique extérieure de la tête (11) est constituée par un film semi-conducteur (14). Un premier anneau limiteur (17) monté sur un corps de moteur (6) est constitué par un premier film incurvé (16) et un second anneau limiteur (17) monté sur la tête d'atomisation rotative (11) est constitué par un second film incurvé (18). Par ailleurs, la surface extérieure de l'arbre (9) est constituée par un film semi-conducteur (19) disposé entre les films incurvés (18, 19). Une tension électrique élevée appliquée au moteur pneumatique (5) alimente le bord de décharge de peinture (12E) de la tête d'alimentation rotative&lt; &gt;(11) via, successivement, le premier film incurvé (16), le film semi-conducteur d'alimentation en courant (19), le second film incurvé (18) et le film semi-conducteur (14) de la tête d'atomisation.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>